    <string name="precision_gnss_note">Requests full GNSS tracking for up to 15 minutes. This can keep the receiver active and use more power, even after leaving navigation. Supported bands may track more consistently, but improved accuracy is not guaranteed. Stop at any time using the switch, tile or notification. It stops when Location is disabled and never resumes after a reboot. No coordinates, NMEA or raw measurements are recorded.</string>

